WEBVTT

00:00:06.409 --> 00:00:12.409
Choose Videos in the side menu.

00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:18.970
Type "Counting" in the Search box.

00:00:20.367 --> 00:00:26.367
Click Counting Money in
Naira to open the video.

00:00:28.979 --> 00:00:34.979
Scroll to Maturity rating.

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:41.468
Click Publish.

00:00:43.137 --> 00:00:49.137
Check that Maturity rating
(required) is in the box.

00:00:52.231 --> 00:00:58.231
Select PG from Maturity rating (required).

00:01:00.607 --> 00:01:06.607
Click Cancel.

00:01:07.641 --> 00:01:13.641
Scroll to Before you publish.
